ary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_MOO_ExecutionerNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_MOO_ExecutionerNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_MOO_ExecutionerNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">dfb4bb97-3d01-43ec-a6e9-632395149f7d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dfb4bb97-3d01-43ec-a6e9-632395149f7d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dfb4bb97-3d01-43ec-a6e9-632395149f7d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glourik\" title=\"Glourik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Glourik.png/25px-Portrait_Glourik.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Glourik.png/38px-Portrait_Glourik.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Glourik.png/50px-Portrait_Glourik.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glourik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Glourik.png/25px-Portrait_Glourik.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Portrait_Glourik.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glourik\" title=\"Glourik\">Glourik</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Balthazar has sent neither word nor notice. Wherever he's gone is a mystery. Need someone to investigate <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers#Balthazar's_room\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">his chambers</a>, but no doubt he's rigged the thing to high <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Hells\" title=\"Nine Hells\">Hells</a>. Perhaps <a href=\"/wiki/Hobgoblin\" title=\"Hobgoblin\">hobgoblins</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30709/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7458/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933761/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.481      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.481      1 -total\n 66.32%   29.498      9 Template:Icon_text\n 58.94%   26.216     21 Template:Trim\n 32.07%   14.263      1 Template:PageSeo\n 31.97%   14.219      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 30.13%   13.403      3 Template:CharLink\n 28.75%   12.790      4 Template:Icon_link\n 20.84%    9.269      9 Template:Ifempty\n 20.46%    9.100      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12735-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715063746 and revision id 382295. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}